  <Intro>k__BackingField: Ulfgar the First carried an axe with the oath of the clans cut into its blade. He died in the Red Waste, and the red wyrm's brood has slept on his bones ever since. A chief with that axe in his fist needs no other argument.
  <Outro>k__BackingField: The runes on the blade still burn. Nobody argues with Grom any more.
  <Goal>k__BackingField: Find the Runed Axe of the Clans.
